{
  "name": "@paystage/mcp",
  "version": "0.8.16",
  "description": "x402 payment safety, agent spend policy and a payment firewall for autonomous agents: ten MCP tools that stop your agent paying a drainer and limit agent spending of USDC on Base before the wallet signs. pay / review / do_not_pay, with the rule that fired. Read-only \u2014 holds no keys, never signs.",
